            "review_title": "Review at Kazama Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ngoc\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nBeautiful restaurant and nice staffs\nSep 2019\nI heard about this restaurant via my friends, was coming to this place on Sunday evening. The first impression of this restaurant is a nice design and a beautiful view. The staffs welcomed when I walked into the restaurant and quickly prepare the menu and recommend the food for me. Space was quiet and everything was new and clean.\nThe food was prepared by a Japanese chef and it was really delicious. Some dishes I highly recommend: \n- Shuwashuwa fruit cocktail. This drink, which is the combination of alcohol and frozen fruit and it’s hard to find at another place \n- Grilled salmon flakes cream sauce udon\n- Wagyu steak\n- Tiramisu\nRate: 10/10\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 8, 2019",
