            "review_text": "Nhung Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nNice restaurant\nAug 2019\nLocation: \n- Center of Thao Dien area, near Thao Dien Vincom MegaMal\nSpace:\n- The ambiance of this restaurant was really classy, airy and exquisite\n- The restaurant has a garden and a lake with many fish, a beautiful view, a nice place to have lunch/ dinner with family or dating\n- Quite and cool, suitable for working alone, team working and party organization\nFood:\n- The food is cooked by a Japanese chef so if you like Japanese taste, I highly recommend you to go to this place.\nService:\n- Friendly staffs\n- Fast and dedicated services\nRate: 9/10\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 8, 2019",
